    "steps": [
      {
        "title": "slope equation",
        "latex": "bm^2+2hm+a=0,\\quad m_1+m_2=-\\frac{2h}{b},\\quad m_1m_2=\\frac ab",
        "note": "দুই বাস্তব রেখার জন্য discriminant ≥ 0 ⇒ h²≥ab।"
